of their products are not natural as they claim.  Bars have several variations of fructos syrup and corn syrup under different names,  their extra relief dry skin cream is basically glyc","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B075Z3MGH8-6","r":5.0,"t":"Works for me.","x":"Have used this product many years now. It does have an odor but its kinda like cloves and aromatherapy for me and wife. No, it doesn't make you smell like \"Uncle Charley\" it actually works well. We've tryed several other products but keep going back to this. I use it for muscle sorenes and on my feet for diabetic foot pain.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B075Z3MGH8-7","r":5.0,"t":"used to be $11 now it\u2019s $22 it is good, wondering why so high.","x":"Used for The severe  pain in my back and my foot & tendons. The product doesn\u2019t last very long and I think it\u2019s too pricey but it does work it used to be $11 a tube now it\u2019s $22 just wanna know why you raised it so high it is very good product though.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B075Z3MGH8-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great for muscle and joint pain","x":"Love it.  Used it for maybe 20 yrs.  some of my pain only responds to this.  I have lots of stuff.  Arthritis, fibromyalgia, nerve damage, disc problems.  Smells nice.  Doesn't feel icky on skin.  Don't believe it stains clothes.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B075Z3MGH8-9","r":5.0,"t":"It works the best!","x":"This product is the most effective pain reliever I have.  It never fails to give relief as a topical product.  I have ordered it several times.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B075Z3MGH8-10","r":5.0,"t":"Really eorks","x":"We\u2019ve used this for years and nothing we\u2019ve tried can beat it.  It is a bit pricey, but worth the relief!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B075Z3MGH8-11","r":5.0,"t":"It Really helps!","x":"It does work! It is worth the money and starts working pretty quickly after application.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B075Z3MGH8-12","r":5.0,"