 for sore shoulder muscles. A bit pricey, but I gave it go. Put it on and it burned like the dickens. I couldn\u2019t even tell if it did any good.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B075Z3MGH8-20","r":5.0,"t":"It\u2019s a Tie","x":"Dealing with upper back and shoulder tension. A Friend has been suggesting that I try this. It works, but I find it a Tie between this and Tiger Sport when in comes to Pain Cream.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B075Z3MGH8-21","r":5.0,"t":"It helps make the pain less!!!","x":"I love this cream. I'm in pain all the time. This pain cream helps alot!!! Don't have to take more pills. If your in pain TRY IT. Make sure you wash your hands or wear gloves.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B075Z3MGH8-22","r":5.0,"t":"Works well","x":"Kind of expensive for the amount you get, but it works well enough that you don't care at the time. I will have it on hand all the time bc of my arthritis and low back pain.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B075Z3MGH8-23","r":5.0,"t":"Best Pain Relief Ever!","x":"Pain relief is quick and this product really works as promised! My family and friends swear by this miracle in a tube. If you need pain relief this is the best solution!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B075Z3MGH8-24","r":5.0,"t":"Finally relief!","x":"I told a friend of the relief my husband has had and she told 2 other friends and they also expressed being very satisfied  with Pain-A-Trate! It really does work!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers widely report that the product effectively relieves muscle, joint, back, and arthritis pain, often working quickly.","cites":[1,2,3,4,5,9,10,12,13,14,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers have used the product for years and say it outperforms other pain relief products they have tried.","cites":[7,9,10,11,14,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the product too pricey, with one noting the price rose from $11 to $22 and another saying it doesn't last long.","cites":[8,11]